## Command-line tool

The same API from a terminal: download `serverroom` for your system from the
[releases page](https://github.com/primcast/serverroom-cli/releases), then

```sh
serverroom login                     # paste your API key
serverroom servers list
serverroom stock --location "New York" --max-price 100
serverroom reinstall 246447 --os "Debian 12" --ssh-key-file ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub --yes --wait
serverroom rescue start 246447 --ssh-key-file ~/.ssh/id_ed25519.pub --yes
```
